          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Passive suicidal ideation: “easier if I didn’t wake up.” Last week, thought of overdosing on partner’s sleeping tablets. No current active plan today; patient reports being ambivalent and not caring what happens to her half the time. No previous attempts; history of superficial cutting as a teenager. Formal suicidality screen today assessed moderate risk. Patient agrees to seek help if suicidal ideation increases and is able to safety plan."
      }
